    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ping Pong Up, your reflexes and precision will be the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play face to face with up to 4 friends or against the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is your longest ping pong streak? Prove it with \u201cChallenge\u201d mode and reach Number 1 on the online ranking. But careful with the bonuses that will appear! Some will help you improve your score while others could end your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to play, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Twin-stick controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 or 4 player Vs-mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge mode with bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game mode against the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online ranking.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ping Pong Up, your reflexes and precision will be the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play face to face with up to 4 friends or against the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is your longest ping pong streak? Prove it with \u201cChallenge\u201d mode and reach Number 1 on the online ranking. But careful with the bonuses that will appear! Some will help you improve your score while others could end your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to play, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Twin-stick controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 or 4 player Vs-mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge mode with bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game mode against the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online ranking.</p>",
